OL,3,ABid to overturn ruling which stops
OL,4,Apolice being sued for failings
OL,5,
OL,6,FBackbench MPs are seeking to roll back
OL,7,Fa court ruling they say will have
OL,8,F"devastating consequences" for victims
OL,9,Fof crime by preventing them taking
OL,10,Flegal action against the police, even
OL,11,Fwhen there have been grave
OL,12,Finvestigative failings.
OL,14,FThe 2025 Court of Appeal judgment,
OL,15,Fwhich applies to England and Wales,
OL,16,Fheld that police officers are immune
OL,17,Ffrom civil litigation both in their
OL,18,Frole as witnesses, and for conduct or
OL,19,Fstatements they make when carrying out
OL,20,Fcriminal investigations.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
